## About This Software

**Dudi PDF Editor** is a 100% free, privacy-focused, browser-based PDF, document,
and image tool suite that runs entirely client-side. All 60+ tools process files
locally in the user's browser — no uploads to servers, no signup, no registration,
no watermarks.

- Website: https://dudipdfeditor.in
- Contact: contact@dudipdfeditor.in
- Organization: Dudi Tech Innovations
- Founder: Jagdish Dudi
- Lead Developer: Vikram Dudi
- Total Tools: 60+ Free Web Tools
- Languages: English, Hindi

## Key Principles

- Zero Server Uploads — files never leave the user's device
- No Signup Required — use any tool instantly
- No Watermarks — clean outputs, always
- No File Limits — unlimited conversions, unlimited files
- 100% Free Forever — no premium tiers, no subscriptions
- GDPR & CCPA Friendly — no data collection, no logging, no tracking
- Made in India — for the world 🌏

